\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}2{e}^{t/2}\\sqrt{{({e}^{t/2})}^{2}+{({e}^{t})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}2{e}^{t/2}\\sqrt{{e}^{t}+{e}^{2t}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}2{e}^{t/2}\\sqrt{{e}^{t}(1+{e}^{t})}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{e}^{t/2}\\cdot {e}^{t/2}\\sqrt{1+{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{e}^{t}\\sqrt{1+{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe evaluate the last integral using the substitution $u=1+{e}^{t}.$ Then, $\\text{d}u={e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t.$ We also need to compute new limits, given below.\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $\\operatorname{ln}⁡3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}S & =4\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{e}^{t}\\sqrt{1+{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4\\pi {\\int }_{2}^{4}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4\\pi {\\int }_{2}^{4}{u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4\\pi \\cdot {\\frac{2{u}^{3/2}}{3}|}_{2}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\pi }{3}({4}^{3/2}-{2}^{3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\pi }{3}(8-2\\sqrt{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{16\\pi }{3}(4-\\sqrt{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-8fe28743-a486-54a9-8fdd-bcbf858bcbbf" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-c5e8aa5a-ac76-5fe7-8cbb-d1e2111d6174" :answer-field/id #uuid "c5e8aa5a-ac76-5fe7-8cbb-d1e2111d6174"] ["answer-9273e530-04e8-5996-b68a-1f42eb0f608e" :answer/id #uuid "9273e530-04e8-5996-b68a-1f42eb0f608e"] ["answer-9273e530-04e8-5996-b68a-1f42eb0f608e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9273e530-04e8-5996-b68a-1f42eb0f608e" :answer/value "\\frac{16\\pi }{3}(2-\\sqrt{2})"] ["answer-e892a90b-d1ba-521a-b1de-129de62c0978" :answer/id #uuid "e892a90b-d1ba-521a-b1de-129de62c0978"] ["answer-e892a90b-d1ba-521a-b1de-129de62c0978" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e892a90b-d1ba-521a-b1de-129de62c0978" :answer/value "\\frac{16\\pi }{3}(4-\\sqrt{2})"] ["answer-00514e84-3144-5df4-82c2-33eb39ce6